      "permissions": [],
      "permissions_mode": "all",
      "who": "a holder of the request's required_permission while the request's can_decide is true (decide_blocked says why not); never its requester (SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN, self_decision forbidden), except the Owner of a solo practice who alone can decide their own refund, waiver or credit, with a note (self_decision allowed_with_note); a large cash drop is never approved by the cashier of its shift (DUAL_CONTROL_SAME_PERSON)"
    },
    "description": "Requires the request's `required_permission`. You never approve your own request (`SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN`,\n`details` says why: `solo_practice_mode`, `owner`, `other_approvers`), except the Owner of a solo practice who is\nthe only person able to decide a refund, waiver or credit: with the Owner's `solo_practice_mode` on, that Owner\napproves their own request with a `note` (without one: `VALIDATION_ERROR`); the answer says\n`solo_self_approved: true` and a risk item records it. The request's `can_decide` and `self_decision` say all this\nin advance. `APPROVAL_ALREADY_DECIDED`: decided already. `DUAL_CONTROL_SAME_PERSON`: a large cash drop is never\napproved by the cashier of its shift (no co-signer is typed here); `SELF_ROLE_CHANGE_FORBIDDEN`: nobody\nchanges their own roles; `LAST_OWNER`: an approved role change would leave the hospital without an active Owner.",
    "roles_allowed": [],
